# The Worker that files in-app feedback as a GitHub issue (see worker/).
#
# Not a secret: this URL ships inside the JS bundle either way, and the Worker
# only accepts posts from the site's own origin. Committed so that CI builds and
# a fresh clone both get the working feedback path with no extra setup.
#
# Unset it (or set it empty in .env.local) to fall back to opening GitHub's
# prefilled new-issue page instead of posting to the Worker.
VITE_FEEDBACK_ENDPOINT=https://ir-procedure-navigator.shreyaspuducheri23.workers.dev
